cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper below."
title: "VGGT-DP: Generalizable Robot Control via Vision Foundation Models"
abstract: >-
  VGGT-DP is a visuomotor policy framework that integrates geometric priors from
  a pretrained 3D perception model with proprioceptive feedback. It uses the
  Visual Geometry Grounded Transformer (VGGT) as a frozen visual encoder for a
  diffusion policy and is evaluated on MetaWorld manipulation tasks.
type: software
license: MIT
